<h2>Segment 350 &mdash; mistaken identity and taking ones own life</h2>
<div class="pair">
<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s350S"><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p1">ma</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w2">nor</span> bar zhes pas <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w3">lha sbyin</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p4">lta bu</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w5">gsod pa</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w6">sbyor ba</span> byas nas, gzhan mchod sbyin dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w7">nor</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p8">nas</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w9">mchod sbyin</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w10">bsad</span> kyang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w11">las lam</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p12">gyi</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w13"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s350m14">dngos</span> gzhi</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p15">mi</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w16">&#x27;byung</span> bar <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w17">bstan</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w18">gzhan</span> zhes pas <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s350f19">rang bsad pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p20">la</span> las lam gyi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w21"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s350m22">dngos</span> gzhi</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p23">mi</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w24">&#x27;byung</span> bar <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w25">bstan</span> <span class="u conj" data-d="6" data-l="s350p26">to</span></span>
</div>
<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s350S">The words &quot;<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p1">without</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w2">mistake</span>&quot; are meant to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w17">indicate</span> that <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p15">no</span> &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w13"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s350m14">actual</span>- commission</span>&quot; stage <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p12">of</span> an <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w11">act</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w16">occurs</span> in a case of mistaken identity; <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p4">for example</span>, in a case where you <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w6">undertake</span> to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w5">kill</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w3">John</span> but instead <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w10">kill</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w9">Joe</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p8">because</span> you have <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w7">mistaken</span> him for John. The word &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w18">another</span>,&quot; finally, is meant to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w25">indicate</span> that <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p23">no</span> &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w21"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s350m22">actual</span>-commission</span>&quot; stage <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s350w24">occurs</span> either in an instance <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p20">where</span> one <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s350f19">takes his own life</span>.<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s350p26"><span class="nul">Terminal TO is the terminating particle after the final indication statement. Its complete glossary explicitly gives a period. English closes that same explanation with the final period after life; declarative closure is fused into that punctuation, with no separate lexical exponent. It is not either English infinitive to before indicate.</span></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, root reconciliation after independent proposals and source review. Keep intended John and actual Joe distinct. Separate both technical-name/no/occurs/indicate groups, preserving literal actual- commission versus actual-commission. DNGOS GZHI owns the technical name inside the quotes, with the surrounding quotation marks and explanatory stage unbanked. Whole self-killing remains d3. Terminal TO has a d6 punctuation-fusion null, cls=conj, justified by its complete period gloss and local final closure; neither infinitive to is used. No source/master change or hgm_gloss promotion.</div>
